set_perp_tpsl: description, inputSchema  -Set +Set, amend or cancel -and/or +/ -create-tpsl) +create-tpsl / update-tpsl, or None when the caller can broadcast itself) -endpoint. +endpoint when the build needs it. AMEND / CANCEL a resting trigger: read its ``request_id`` off perp_positions_all (positions[].tpsl_triggers[].request_id), then call this tool with ``request_id`` and either ``trigger_price`` (amend -- moves the trigger to that price) or ``cancel=True`` (cancel it). position_id and take_profit_price/stop_loss_price are not used in those modes, and mixing them with request_id is refused. Same gates (including the AU block), s  parameters: +input.cancel input.cancel default: false +input.position_id default: "" input.request_id input.request_id default: null +input.trigger_price input.trigger_price default: null
